<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan brokers report fake Inventec shares.</title>
<headline>Taiwan brokers report fake Inventec shares.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that two securities brokerages had reported finding unspecified numbers of counterfeit shares of computer maker Inventec Corp.</p>
<p>The exchange said it was investigating the case and asked brokerages and investors to be extra cautious.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Inventec fell T$7 or 3.76 percent to T$179 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It was unclear whether the fall was related to the fake shares.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
